
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7076

### PRODUCTOS

### GET Productos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/productos
Accept: application/json


### POST Productos
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/productos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Monitor Samsung 24 pulgadas",
  "descripcion": "Monitor LED Full HD de 24 pulgadas",
  "codigoSku": "MON-001",
  "precio": 150000,
  "stock": 10,
  "stockMinimo": 3,
  "categoriaId": 1
}

###


@productoId = 1

### PUT Productos
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/productos/{{productoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Monitor Samsung",
  "descripcion": "Monitor LED de 24 pulgadas Full HD",
  "precio": 110000,
  "stock": 12
}

### PATCH Productos(Stock)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/productos/{{productoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 25
}

### DELETE producto
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/productos/3
Accept: application/json





### CATEGORIA




### GET 
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categorias
Accept: application/json

